Article 2 (Definitions)
The terms used in these Regulations are defined as follows:
1. "Cost estimate" means materials estimating the net increase in fiscal expenditure or net decrease in fiscal revenue (hereinafter referred to as "costs") expected to arise if a bill introduced, proposed or submitted is implemented (hereinafter referred to as "estimating costs");
2. "Fiscal expenditure" means expenditures from the general and special accounts of the State and local governments and expenditures from funds (hereinafter referred to as "funds") established under Acts specified in attached Table 2 of the National Finance Act;
3. "Fiscal revenue" means revenues of the general and special accounts of the State and local governments and receipts of funds.
